@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001
@apiVersion = 1.0
@contentType = application/json

### Captured Public Tracking Token (Sent via SMS / Email)
@trackingToken = 4AA44B0E-C197-4616-A238-009BC4FCD3AF

### 1. Get Live Public Vehicle Tracking Details (Anonymous Access - No Token Required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/tracking/{{trackingToken}}

### 2. Request Stripe Checkout Session for Invoice Balance (Anonymous Access)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/tracking/{{trackingToken}}/pay
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "successUrl": "http://localhost:3000/track/{{trackingToken}}?payment=success",
  "cancelUrl": "http://localhost:3000/track/{{trackingToken}}?payment=cancelled"
}